  <h2>1. About Bronzed</h2>
  <p>
    Bronzed is a sun and tanning companion that estimates safe sun-exposure times based on your skin
    type and the real-time UV index, and guides tanning sessions with timed routines. It is provided
    for general informational and wellness purposes only.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Health &amp; Safety Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>Please read this section carefully.</strong> Exposure to ultraviolet (UV) radiation from
    the sun carries real health risks, including sunburn, premature skin ageing, eye damage, and
    skin cancer (including melanoma). By using Bronzed, you acknowledge and agree that:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Bronzed provides <strong>estimates and general guidance</strong> based on the Fitzpatrick
      skin-type model, weather data, and the UV index. These are <strong>not a guarantee</strong>
      that you will not burn or suffer skin damage.
    </li>
    <li>
      Bronzed is <strong>not</strong> a medical device and does <strong>not</strong> provide medical
      advice. It is not a substitute for professional advice from a qualified dermatologist or
      healthcare provider.
    </li>
    <li>
      Individual skin responds to the sun differently. UV levels can change rapidly with weather,
      altitude, reflection (water, snow, sand), and time of day, and our data may be delayed or
      inaccurate.
    </li>
    <li>
      You should always follow official sun-safety guidance, use broad-spectrum sunscreen, seek
      shade, protect your eyes, and <strong>stop sun exposure immediately</strong> if your skin
      shows any sign of burning or discomfort — regardless of what the app shows.
    </li>
    <li>
      You should consult a doctor before sun exposure if you have fair or sensitive skin, a history
      of skin cancer, a condition or medication that increases sun sensitivity, or any other health
      concern.
    </li>
    <li>You use Bronzed and expose yourself to the sun <strong>entirely at your own risk</strong>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Bronzed does not promote excessive sun exposure or tanning beyond safe limits, and it is not
    intended for use with artificial tanning beds.
  </p>

